# Python 3.13 source CI inputs. Keep the runtime contract in requirements.txt.
# Resolve with uv==0.12.21, binary wheels only, and official PyPI metadata.
# Per-platform PyTorch URLs come from the official CPU wheel index; this keeps
# PyPI's Linux CUDA builds out of the graph without mixing package indexes.
-r ../../requirements.txt
-r requirements-pytorch-cpu.in
